{"2221490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tom Clancy’s The Division® 2", "steam_appid": 2221490, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "dlc": [4974000, 4973980, 4974020, 3572140, 3572160, 2222570, 3268800], "detailed_description": "<h1>Comparative Grid</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/4c684ccf8cae7584e5a7a08601008911.avif?t=1787834254\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras_big/4c684ccf8cae7584e5a7a08601008911.avif?t=1787834254 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><br><h1>Ultimate Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/b466ddccb23ca3c5a844499605c24a70.avif?t=1787834254\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras_big/b466ddccb23ca3c5a844499605c24a70.avif?t=1787834254 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TOM CLANCY’S THE DIVISION 2 ULTIMATE EDITION INCLUDES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· The base game;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· The Warlords of New York expansion;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· The Battle for Brooklyn DLC;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· 1,000 bonus Premium Credits;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· A level 40 boost, allowing you to jump into the Battle for Brooklyn campaign;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Stash space increase;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· All six endgame specializations instantly unlocked;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Eight additional missions;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· The Battleworn Secret Service Pack;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· The First Responder Pack;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· The Elite Agent Pack;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· One exclusive emote and outfit.</p></p><br><h1>Gold Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/43b4d4a752cd56c7b79e39b08232f31a.avif?t=1787834254\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br><br>TOM CLANCY’S THE DIVISION 2 GOLD EDITION INCLUDES:<br><br>· The base game;<br>· The Warlords of New York expansion;<br>· The Battle for Brooklyn DLC;<br>· A level 40 boost, allowing you to jump into the Battle for Brooklyn campaign;<br>· Stash space increase.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Defend and rebuild Washington, D.C. after a devastating pandemic in this tactical open world third-person shooter:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TACTICAL COMBAT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/148a120980b159cd8923fef7fccfb4bf.poster.avif?t=1787834254\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/148a120980b159cd8923fef7fccfb4bf.webm?t=1787834254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/148a120980b159cd8923fef7fccfb4bf.mp4?t=1787834254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Engage enemies in intense, cover-based firefights where tactical positioning and utility usage make the difference between life and death.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD THE ULTIMATE AGENT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/fdaf7df9fe1484ea1649a2a21545c853.poster.avif?t=1787834254\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/fdaf7df9fe1484ea1649a2a21545c853.webm?t=1787834254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/fdaf7df9fe1484ea1649a2a21545c853.mp4?t=1787834254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Loot and craft cutting-edge gear and learn powerful skills to customize the way you fight. Take things further with Specializations, with roles like the long-range marksman, the demolition expert, the survivalist leader, and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAMWORK SAVES LIVES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/75289faeadbb3622410780aba911ad57.poster.avif?t=1787834254\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/75289faeadbb3622410780aba911ad57.webm?t=1787834254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/75289faeadbb3622410780aba911ad57.mp4?t=1787834254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Team up with up to three other agents for tactical co-op missions where synergy matters. Combine Specializations, share resources, and take on dynamic challenges that scale with your squad.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE EVER-EVOLVING WASHINGTON, D.C.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/3d622aa311d0252311dda92da1e764ed.poster.avif?t=1787834254\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/3d622aa311d0252311dda92da1e764ed.webm?t=1787834254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221490/extras/3d622aa311d0252311dda92da1e764ed.mp4?t=1787834254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>From tense firefights in changing weather to the constant push and pull of factions warring over map control, the c